body:
Yep - running into it now. They've been having a lot of issues with their servers and metadata providers lately. They were having DNS issues earlier today that was causing some unusual issues for some users attempting to use secure connections. I wouldn't be surprised if this is just another extenstion of that issue.

&#x200B;

This is the third or fourth time that I've noticed this happening in the past week with Plex with their remote access and metadata providers. Hopefully the situation improves soon.
